msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Markers` sub-menu allows you to add, edit and remove markers "
"from your clips that are displayed on the timeline.  These markers will move "
"with the clips.  See :ref:`markers`."
msgstr ""
"Podmeni označevalcev omogoča dodajanje, urejanje in odstranjevanje "
"označevalcev iz posnetkov, prikazanih na časovnici.  Ti označevalci se bodo "
"premaknili s posnetki.  Glejte :ref:`markerji`."

#: ../../cutting_and_assembling/right_click_menu.rst:96
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The :menuselection:`Align to Reference` sub-menu allows you to set either "
#| "audio or SMPTE-esque timecode to a reference. This is useful if two or "
